   1:Core/Src/hca_lib.c **** /**
   2:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * @file hca_lib.c
   3:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
   4:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * @brief
   5:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * High-performance C implementation of the Harmonic Control Array (HCA)
   6:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * controller using parallel complex PI controllers.
   7:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
   8:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * @details
   9:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * This library implements the Harmonic Control Array (HCA) control structure
  10:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * using Direct Digital Synthesis (DDS) and LUT-based trigonometric evaluation
  11:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * for deterministic real-time execution.
  12:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
  13:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * The implementation focuses on clarity, numerical robustness, and suitability
  14:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * for embedded real-time systems, while remaining portable to desktop platforms.
  15:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
  16:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * @author
  17:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * Eray Mercan
  18:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
  19:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * @par Algorithm attribution
  20:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * The control algorithm implemented in this file is based on:
  21:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
  22:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * Murat Doğruel and Hasan Hüseyin Çelik,
  23:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * "Harmonic Control Arrays Method With a Real Time Application to Periodic Position Control,"
  24:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * IEEE Transactions on Control Systems Technology,
  25:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * vol. 19, Issue: 3, May 2011.
  26:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * DOI: 10.1109/TCST.2010.2048110
  27:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  *
  28:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * ---
  29:Core/Src/hca_lib.c ****  * License:
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccdaEPKf.s 			page 2


